<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle market not tested- USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle market not tested- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Carcass basis Steers and heifers not fully established with a higher undertone noted.</p>
<p>Steers -  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1225-1300 lbs few 108.00</p>
<p>Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs 1.5 lds 108.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Wed -  300   Week to Date - 9,500</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
